WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.518 --> 00:00:03.281
Morning begins at the river Kolpa.

00:00:03.495 --> 00:00:05.156
Ten minutes on foot,

00:00:05.323 --> 00:00:06.562
and you are in.

00:00:07.002 --> 00:00:09.375
Swimming you never tire of.

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:11.250
A natural slide,

00:00:11.374 --> 00:00:13.125
shallow enough to stand.

00:00:13.694 --> 00:00:16.875
Two houses, two addresses in Griblje.

00:00:17.238 --> 00:00:19.688
Four self-contained apartments.

00:00:20.251 --> 00:00:22.969
Seven beds in two bedrooms,

00:00:23.585 --> 00:00:26.250
and bunk beds for the children.

00:00:26.872 --> 00:00:30.000
Kitchens equipped down to the detail.

00:00:30.372 --> 00:00:33.281
Each house with its own
terrace and garden.

00:00:33.564 --> 00:00:35.156
a summer kitchen,

00:00:35.416 --> 00:00:37.500
and a pergola in the shade.

00:00:37.838 --> 00:00:40.312
For the children a meadow with goals,

00:00:40.732 --> 00:00:43.125
and pastry from their own oven.

00:00:43.512 --> 00:00:45.938
Warm water right outside,

00:00:46.106 --> 00:00:47.812
and a garden all yours.

00:00:48.363 --> 00:00:51.094
Bubbles under hanging flowers.

00:00:51.269 --> 00:00:52.500
At dusk,

00:00:52.806 --> 00:00:55.312
a line of lights across the garden.

00:00:55.795 --> 00:01:00.000
River Kolpa Apartments,
Griblje. Call Majda.
